  "notes": "{燃|も}やす is a transitive godan verb meaning to burn something deliberately.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{燃|も}える→燃える：02312_moeru⟧ (intransitive, to burn by itself)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦ゴミ→ゴミ：00840_gomi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{燃|も}やす: to burn garbage\n- ⟦{落|お}ち{葉|ば}→落ち葉：14108_ochiba⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{燃|も}やす: to burn fallen leaves\n- ⟦{書類|しょるい}→書類：01103_shorui⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{燃|も}やす: to burn documents\n\nGARBAGE SORTING:\n- {燃|も}える⟦ゴミ→ゴミ：00840_gomi⟧/⟦{可燃|かねん}→可燃：26077_kanen⟧ゴミ: combustible garbage\n- {燃|も}えないゴミ/不燃ゴミ: non-combustible garbage\n\nUSAGE:\n- ⟦{情熱|じょうねつ}→情熱：05087_jounetsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{燃|も}やす: to burn with passion\n- ⟦{闘志|とうし}→闘志：19440_toushi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{燃|も}やす: to be fired up (for competition)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{燃|も}える→燃える：02312_moeru⟧: to burn (intransitive)\n- ⟦{焼|や}く→焼く：01123_yaku⟧: to grill, roast, bake",
